# Submissions used to live at /student/<ID>/ before the site was organised by
# problem set. Everything there was a Problem Set 01 submission, so old links
# and bookmarks are sent to the new location.
#
# Cloudflare reads this file natively and does not serve it:
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/redirects/
#
# Static rules first, then the placeholder and splat rules. /student/:id goes
# straight to the trailing-slash page in one hop; the splat catches deeper
# paths such as /student/<ID>/index.html. Paths are case-sensitive.
/ps / 301
/ps/ / 301
/student /ps/01/ 301
/student/:id /ps/01/:id/ 301
/student/* /ps/01/:splat 301
